Relationship to WeeWX
---------------------

WeeWX is a separate project. This repository is an independent skin and chart
generator intended to run with WeeWX. It does not claim ownership of WeeWX and
does not bundle WeeWX source code.

Logo / frog artwork
-------------------

The frog-under-umbrella artwork in skins/Wfrog/frog_umbrella.png was supplied
to this project as the classic wFrog artwork and is included for interface
compatibility. The current upstream wFrog GitHub repository clearly documents
the GPL license for its source code, but an independent asset-specific license
statement for this particular historical image was not located during project
preparation.

The image is NOT claimed as an original work of Marcin Kowalik. If you require
strict asset-level provenance for redistribution, replace or remove the image
while retaining the software license and source-code attributions above.
